== Effect ==
* {{dlc|nr}} Heals for a {{E|Half Red Heart}} upon traveling to the next floor.
* {{dlc|r}} Heals 50% of Isaac's empty {{E|Red Heart}}s and {{E|Bone Heart|n}}s (rounded down), but at minimum a half heart, upon traveling to the next floor.

== Synergies ==
* {{i|Blood Oath|n}}: The healing will occur before any health is drained, allowing for a greater stat bonus.
* {{i|Glowing Hourglass}}: Returning to a previous floor will keep the health gained from Stem Cell, as well as granting another half-red heart after going down to the next floor again.
* {{C|Tainted Magdalene}}: Since all red heart healing is doubled, Stem Cell will bring her to full health.

== Interactions ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: Heals all empty red hearts upon entering a new floor.
* {{C|Tainted Bethany}}: Adds 1 blood charge.

